#. module: ssi_school_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_admission.field_school_admission_fee_analysis__term_state
msgid ""
"Billing status of the payment term: Draft = admission still in draft/"
"confirm, Uninvoiced = admission open/done but no customer invoice yet, "
"Invoiced = customer invoice created, Paid = the linked customer invoice is "
"fully paid, Voided = every detail line has had its amount moved to another "
"payment term, Manually Controlled = managed manually, Cancelled = the "
"admission itself was cancelled."
msgstr "Status penagihan termin pembayaran: Draf = penerimaan masih dalam draf/konfirmasi, Belum Difakturkan = penerimaan terbuka/selesai tetapi belum ada faktur pelanggan, Sudah Difakturkan = faktur pelanggan sudah dibuat, Lunas = faktur pelanggan terkait sudah lunas sepenuhnya, Dinihilkan = seluruh baris detail telah dipindahkan jumlahnya ke termin pembayaran lain, Dikendalikan Manual = dikelola secara manual, Dibatalkan = penerimaan itu sendiri dibatalkan."

