#. module: ssi_school_admission
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_school_admission.field_school_admission_payment_term__state
msgid ""
"Draft = admission still in draft/confirm, Uninvoiced = admission open/done "
"but no customer invoice yet, Invoiced = customer invoice created, Paid = the "
"linked customer invoice is fully paid, Voided = every detail line has had "
"its amount moved to another payment term, Manually Controlled = managed "
"manually, Cancelled = the admission itself was cancelled."
msgstr "Draf = penerimaan masih dalam draf/konfirmasi, Belum Difakturkan = penerimaan terbuka/selesai tetapi belum ada faktur pelanggan, Sudah Difakturkan = faktur pelanggan sudah dibuat, Lunas = faktur pelanggan terkait sudah lunas sepenuhnya, Dinihilkan = seluruh baris detail telah dipindahkan jumlahnya ke termin pembayaran lain, Dikendalikan Manual = dikelola secara manual, Dibatalkan = penerimaan itu sendiri dibatalkan."

